Except where Section 2 or applicable law permits the use, You must obtain a separate written license from Licensor before:

(a) Deploying the Software or a derivative of its protected code to a production blockchain or production service.
(b) Using the Software or such a derivative to provide a commercial product, hosted service, launchpad or mining or reward-distribution service, including a competing service.
(c) Selling, sublicensing or commercially distributing the Software or such a derivative.
(d) Redistributing the complete Software or a substantially complete modified copy, other than private copies permitted for security review under Section 2(c) and rights granted under the public hosting platform terms described in Section 5.

Charging for a security review or technical evaluation permitted under Section 2 does not, by itself, trigger the commercial-use restriction. Licensor may separately authorize uses in writing and specify their terms. Permission requests should use the official contact route at https://minerinu.app.

